          "id": "s1.p1",
          "node_type": "setup",
          "quote": "We evaluated six models from three frontier model families, each represented by their professional and mini variants: Anthropic’s Claude-3.7-Sonnet-20250219 (P) and Claude-3.5-Haiku-20241022 (M); Google’s Gemini-2.5-Pro-Preview-03-25 (P) and Gemini-2.5-Flash-Preview-04-17 (M); and OpenAI’s GPT-4.1-2025-04-14 (P) and GPT-4.1-Mini-2025-04-14 (M)."
        },
        {
          "id": "s1.p2",
          "node_type": "setup",
          "quote": "Due to computational resource constraints, we restricted our evaluation to SCIGYM-small, with a total of 137 tasks.",
